line	<col=000080>Investigate the <col=800000>gnome statue</col> and turn it to unlock the <col=800000>cupboard</col>.</col>
step	7	-	Quick guide step 7
line	<str>Talk to King Narnode Shareen, located in the Gnome Stronghold's Grand tree.</str>
